{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":360,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300,"x":360,"bright":1,"transTime":0,"y":-180,"nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]你说你想知道猫型魔人擅长什么？[r][l]嗯……这种问题还真不好回答。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]就好比我突然问你，人类有什么特殊之处，你也很难说上来吧？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag5","text":"人类没有强壮的身体，所以更擅长设计和使用工具。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]你还真能答上来啊……[r][l]好吧，让我想想。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]贪睡算吗？不算？那……视力好？[r][l]我虽然没有和别人比过，但据说不论光线强弱都能看清周围是猫型魔人特有的能力呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"yd_002_06-备份","des":"米托拉-猫的特质"}